{"id":"n49072-2-7","stage":3,"title":"성질 · 性质","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49072-2-7-1","ko":"물은 높은 곳에서 낮은 곳으로 흐릅니다.","zh":"水是从高处流向低处的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물은","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물은","audio":"/audio/e2ca40c7661f01e567bc.mp3"}},{"text":"높은","meaning":"高","explanation":"높다：高；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"높다","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64523","senseId":"1","lemma":"높다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"높은","audio":"/audio/547757ca987cef7f5b40.mp3"}},{"text":"곳에서","meaning":"处，地方","explanation":"곳：处，地方；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"2","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳에서","audio":"/audio/6a7245778ca2b0319365.mp3"}},{"text":"낮은","meaning":"低，矮，低洼","explanation":"낮다：低，矮，低洼；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"낮다","audio":"/audio/066edc9ea6d8d3424666.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58155","senseId":"1","lemma":"낮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낮은","audio":"/audio/d6b1fe613ff31d9e7e05.mp3"}},{"text":"곳으로","meaning":"处，地方","explanation":"곳：处，地方；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"2","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳으로","audio":"/audio/c021789176025ec61f17.mp3"}},{"text":"흐릅니다.","meaning":"流，流淌","explanation":"흐르다：流，流淌；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"흐르다","audio":"/audio/91dc8d3e5e85cc29b8fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29757","senseId":"1","lemma":"흐르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흐릅니다","audio":"/audio/3eb38577e4f6ece4eadb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"5601621a4a648d5b","term":"높다","zh":"高","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3","entryId":"64523","definition":"上下距离较长。","pronunciation":["놉따"]},{"id":"24875f860934407b","term":"곳","zh":"处，地方","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3","entryId":"18661","definition":"抽象的地点或位置。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"066edc9ea6d8d342","term":"낮다","zh":"低，矮，低洼","audio":"/audio/066edc9ea6d8d3424666.mp3","entryId":"58155","definition":"由下到上的距离较短。","pronunciation":["낟따"]},{"id":"91dc8d3e5e85cc29","term":"흐르다","zh":"流，流淌","audio":"/audio/91dc8d3e5e85cc29b8fa.mp3","entryId":"29757","definition":"水等液体向低处流动或经过某一地点。","pronunciation":["흐르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ff5339b9823aef1e7a74.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49072-2-7-2","ko":"그것이 액체의 물리적 성질이지요.","zh":"那是液体的物理特性啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그것이","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그것：那个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그것","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31953","senseId":"2","lemma":"그것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그것이","audio":"/audio/d9c0ae8efe1aa4e19e3d.mp3"}},{"text":"액체의","meaning":"液体","explanation":"액체：液体；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"액체","audio":"/audio/4ce97cd4707664d36eb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66736","senseId":"1","lemma":"액체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"액체의","audio":"/audio/3814ab203e7376bf3072.mp3"}},{"text":"물리적","meaning":"物理的","explanation":"물리적：物理的","readings":[{"term":"물리적","audio":"/audio/4703059faa5c37fd5ac1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84990","senseId":"1","lemma":"물리적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물리적","audio":"/audio/4703059faa5c37fd5ac1.mp3"}},{"text":"성질이지요.","meaning":"性质","explanation":"성질：性质；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"성질","audio":"/audio/9370ce919281b92fceb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49072","senseId":"2","lemma":"성질","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"성질이지요","audio":"/audio/e9bdb40d44f3055a8aa0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"49ef044188dcd25e","term":"그것","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/49ef044188dcd25ecf37.mp3","entryId":"31953","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그걷"]},{"id":"4ce97cd4707664d3","term":"액체","zh":"液体","audio":"/audio/4ce97cd4707664d36eb3.mp3","entryId":"66736","definition":"与水、油一样虽然有体积但没有一定形态，且具有流动性质的物质。","pronunciation":["액체"]},{"id":"4703059faa5c37fd","term":"물리적","zh":"物理的","audio":"/audio/4703059faa5c37fd5ac1.mp3","entryId":"84990","definition":"基于物质原理的。","pronunciation":["물리적"]},{"id":"9370ce919281b92f","term":"성질","zh":"性质","audio":"/audio/9370ce919281b92fceb4.mp3","entryId":"49072","definition":"事物或现象具有的固有特征。","pronunciation":["성ː질"]}],"audio":"/audio/855c24c1daa98154e9dd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.149,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49072","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":114,"sequenceScore":2.9757,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那是液体的物理特性啊。","我好久没排便了。","水是从高处流向低处的。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那是液体的物理特性啊。","水是从高处流向低处的。","我好久没排便了。"],"answer":0}]}
